libzen notes
------------

bitop		- bitwise operations
fastudiv16	- replace 16-bit division with 32-bit words by faster operations
hash		- hash() and unhash() routines
kern		- kernel tools
mem		- memory management
prof		- profiling routines
tabhash		- cache-friendly hash table implementation

Allocator contributors: read ../../../doc/allocator-design.md before changing
mem.c, mem.h or the malloc shim. It records the bitmap/pointer representation,
queue ownership and lifetime rules, lock ordering, and validation approach.

